		},
		{
			"id": "n_mcp",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# MCP review\n\nQuery the **running** local compose service via `mcp-grafana` (read-only).\nPromQL / LogQL \u2014 not a dashboard screenshot.",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 400,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "n_chaos",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Chaos Monkey\n\nSpring profile `chaos` **only**.\nInject **latency** + **exceptions**.\nDefault compose stays **clean** (no chaos profile).",
			"x": 1900,
			"y": 400,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "n_gaps",
